<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Guestbook • Xandrine's Dreamy Brew</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Press+Start+2P&family=Quicksand:wght@500;700&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-pink: #ffe6f0;
            --pastel-lavender: #e6e6fa;
            --mint-green: #e0f8f0;
            --hot-pink: #ff66b2;
            --deep-purple: #663399;
            --white: #ffffff;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-pink);
            background-image: radial-gradient(var(--hot-pink) 15%, transparent 16%), radial-gradient(var(--pastel-lavender) 15%, transparent 16%);
            background-size: 60px 60px;
            background-position: 0 0, 30px 30px;
            font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
            color: #4a3b5c;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            cursor: url('https://cur.cursors-4u.net/holidays/hol-1/hol14.cur'), auto;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: 'Press Start 2P', cursive;
            font-size: 22px;
            color: var(--hot-pink);
            text-shadow: 2px 2px var(--deep-purple);
        }

        .cafe-menu {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            padding: 15px;
            border-bottom: 4px dashed var(--hot-pink);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 102, 178, 0.2);
        }

        .cafe-menu a {
            text-decoration: none;
            background: var(--pastel-lavender);
            color: var(--deep-purple);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border: 2px solid var(--hot-pink);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .cafe-menu a:hover {
            background: var(--hot-pink);
            color: var(--white);
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            border: 4px solid var(--hot-pink);
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 8px 8px 0px var(--mint-green);
        }

        form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        input,
        textarea {
            padding: 12px;
            border: 2px solid var(--hot-pink);
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-pink);
        }

        button {
            background: var(--hot-pink);
            color: var(--white);
            border: 2px solid var(--deep-purple);
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-family: 'Press Start 2P', cursive;
            font-size: 11px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: var(--deep-purple);
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }

        .note {
            background: var(--pastel-lavender);
            border: 2px dashed var(--hot-pink);
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-family: 'Press Start 2P', cursive;
            color: var(--deep-purple);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>💌 Guestbook • Leave a Note! 💌</h1>
    </header>

    <nav class="cafe-menu">
        <a href="/">☕ Espresso (Home)</a>
        <a href="/about">🧁 Matcha (About)</a>
        <a href="/portfolio">📖 Daily Specials (Assignments)</a>
        <a href="/guestbook">💌 Guestbook</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <h2>Sign My Retro Guestbook ✨</h2>
        <p>Leave a cute little message or feedback before you leave the café!</p>

        <form onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Thank you for your sweet note! 💖');">
            <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name or Nickname 🧸" required>
            <textarea rows="4" placeholder="Write your sweet message here..." required></textarea>
            <button type="submit">Send Note 💌</button>
        </form>

        <div class="note">
            <strong>🎀 Visitor #001 says:</strong>
            <p>"Such an adorable website! Good luck with all your assignments, Xandrine!" ✨</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Xandrine • Made with 💖 and Node.js</p>
    </footer>

</body>

</html>